Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Mobile Device Rules|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Assert Mobile Device Rule Action On Site Page
Priority: 5
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	When Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Page for Linux|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Page for Windows|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Mobile Device Families|
	And MobileDevice add Device Family CP
		|deviceFamilyName|Linux Family Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Mobile Device Families|
	And MobileDevice add Classification Rule CP
		|classificationName|Classification Name|
		|deviceType|Any|
		|mobileDeviceFamilyName|Linux Family Name|
		|ruleOSScope|Linux|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Mobile Device Families|
	And MobileDevice add Device Family CP
		|deviceFamilyName|Windows Device Family Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Mobile Device Families|
	And MobileDevice add Classification Rule CP
		|classificationName|Classification Name|
		|deviceType|Any|
		|mobileDeviceFamilyName|Windows Device Family Name|
		|ruleOSScope|Windows|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Mobile Device Family Test Page|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|Mobile Device Family Test Page|
	And Navigator goto Nav Tab
		|navTab|Advanced|
	And Panel expand Panel
		|panelHeading|Mobile Device Rules|
	And Page disable Mobile Device Rules Are Inherited From Public Pages
	And Page select Mobile Device Family
		|deviceFamilyName|Linux Family Name|
	And Page manage Device Family Actions
		|actionName|Mobile Device Family Test Action|
		|actionType|Redirect to Site|
		|pageName|Page for Linux|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page select Mobile Device Family
		|deviceFamilyName|Windows Device Family Name|
	And Page manage Device Family Actions
		|actionName|Windows Device Family Test Action|
		|actionType|Redirect to Site|
		|pageName|Page for Windows|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator open URL
	Then MobileDevice assert Redirect Action PG
		|pageName|Mobile Device Family Test Page|
		|redirectPageName|Page for Linux|